+### 4.3 list_sessions
+
+Requests summaries of the authenticated user's conversations.
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "list_sessions",
+  "limit": 10,
+  "before": {
+    "updatedAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
+    "sessionId": "s1"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+| Field    | Type          | Required | Description                                               |
+| -------- | ------------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
+| `type`   | string        | Yes      | `"list_sessions"`                                         |
+| `limit`  | number        | No       | Optional non-negative integer maximum number of summaries |
+| `before` | SessionCursor | No       | Optional pagination cursor (`updatedAt` and `sessionId`)  |
+
+Semantics:
+
+- The server lists conversations for the authenticated user (`session.userId`) and ignores any `userId` sent in the frame ([validated by: answers list_sessions for the authenticated user with ISO dates, forwarding limit and before while ignoring any client userId](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L93), [validated by: answers list_sessions for the session userId with ISO dates from the store](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L872)).
+- The validator accepts an optional non-negative integer `limit` and an optional `before` cursor whose `sessionId` is 1–128 characters and whose `updatedAt` parses as a valid timestamp, rejecting any other `list_sessions` payload with `INVALID_MESSAGE` without calling `listFor` ([validated by: accepts a bare list_sessions frame and rejects a malformed limit or before with INVALID_MESSAGE without calling listFor](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L163), [validated by: accepts list_sessions with optional limit and before, dropping unknown fields and rejecting malformed payloads](../../src/transport/ws/validation.test.ts#L24)).
+- A store without `listFor` answers with an empty list (`sessions: []`), and an error during listing is logged on category `'ws'` and answered with `SERVER_ERROR` ([validated by: answers an empty session_list when the store has no listFor, and SERVER_ERROR with a ws error log when listFor throws](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L134)).
 
